        {"zh": "它低吼着，似乎要扑向你。", "en": "It growls low, as if to pounce on you."},
        {"zh": "它开始快速移动。", "en": "It starts to move quickly."},
        {"zh": "它嘶嘶着，准备攻击。", "en": "It hisses, ready to attack."},
        {"zh": "它盯着你，似乎要一口吞掉你。", "en": "It stares at you, as if to devour you."},
