        {"zh": "它嘶叫着，似乎要咬你。", "en": "It screams, as if to bite you."},
        {"zh": "风向对了，我闻到血。", "en": "The wind turns, and I smell blood."},
        {"zh": "你一转身，我正好看见。", "en": "You turn, and I see you."},
        {"zh": "隔着半片林子，我锁定了。", "en": "Across half the woods, I have you."},
        {"zh": "同伴还在走，我已经跑了。", "en": "My kin still walk; I already run."},
        {"zh": "护甲两层，够我冲到跟前。", "en": "Two layers of armor is enough to reach you."}
      ]
    },
